<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 33.35 bln rupees in repos auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 33.35 bln rupees in repos auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained a cut-off interest of 5.0 percent at a repos auction on Saturday.</p>
<p>The RBI said it accepted 37 bids for 33.35 billion rupees out of 44 bids for a total of 35.10 billion rupees.</p>
<p>It said the weighted average cut-off interest rate was 4.9154 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
